#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"The marketplace is a space for exchanges between members. It does not "
"support card payments. The exchange of goods and money takes place outside "
"the app, in person."
msgstr ""
"Markedsplassen er et rom for utveksling mellom medlemmer. Den støtter ikke "
"kortbetalinger. Utveksling av varer og penger skjer utenfor appen, "
"personlig."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid ""
"The marketplace is an internal classifieds section for club members. It "
"allows you to sell your sports equipment to people you trust. Neither the "
"club nor the app charges any commission."
msgstr ""
"Markedsplassen er en intern rubrikkseksjon for klubbmedlemmer. Det lar deg "
"selge sportsutstyret ditt til folk du stoler på. Verken klubben eller appen "
"tar noen provisjon."

